<title>USA: Enviropur Waste loses Nasdaq listing.</title>
<headline>Enviropur Waste loses Nasdaq listing.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enviropur Waste Refining &amp; Technology Inc said because it failed to meet the minimum capital and surplus requirements, it would lose its Nasdaq SmallCap Market listing, effective at the close of business September 25.</p>
<p>The company's reported tangible capital and surplus was determined by Nasdaq to be $816,111 -- below the $2 million minimum requirement.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
